ied?":"Ma guursatay?","Last year I went to Greece, learned Greek and met new friends.":"Sannadkii hore waxaan aaday Giriiga, waxaan bartay Giriiga oo aan la kulmay saaxiibo cusub.","Last year I went to Greece.":"Sannadkii hore waxaan aaday Giriiga.","Let's go to the supermarket.":"Aan tagno dukaanka weyn.","Let's take the bus.":"Aynu raacno baska.","Maria reads every evening and goes downtown on Saturdays.":"Maria waxay wax akhridaa fiid kasta waxayna aadaa badhtamaha magaalada Sabtida.","Monday":"Isniin","My brother has a headache, buys medicine and stays at home.":"Walaahay madax xanuun baa haya, dawo soo iibsadaa guriga ayuu iska joogaa.","My brother is a doctor, my sister is a student, and my cousin is an engineer.":"Walaalkay waa dhakhtar, walaashay waa ardayad, ina-adeerkayna waa injineer.","My colleague has a meeting in the morning and I work on the computer.":"Saaxiibkay waxa uu leeyahay shir subaxdii, waxaanan ka shaqeeyaa kombiyuutarka.","My father is a doctor.":"Aabahay waa dhakhtar.","My father lives in Nicosia and has a mobile phone, but my mother lives in Athens.":"Aabahay wuxuu ku nool yahay Nicosia wuxuuna haystaa teleefan gacanta, laakiin hooyaday waxay ku nooshahay Athens.","My friend is a doctor, his wife is a teacher, and they live in Athens.":"Saaxiibkay waa dhakhtar, xaaskiisuna waa macalimad, waxayna ku nool yihiin Athens.","My friend is married, has a son and a daughter, and lives in Cyprus.":"Saaxiibkay waa guursaday, wuxuu leeyahay wiil iyo gabadh, wuxuuna ku nool yahay Qubrus.","My friend lives in Nicosia, her brother lives in Athens, and her mother lives in Russia.":"Saaxiibkay wuxuu ku nool yahay Nicosia, walaalkeed wuxuu ku nool yahay Athens, hooyadeedna waxay ku nooshahay Ruushka.","My friend speaks Greek and Russian, understands a little German, but does not speak French.":"Saaxiibkay waxa uu ku hadlaa Giriig iyo Ruush, waxa uu fahmayaa Jarmal yar, laakiin kuma hadlo Faransiis.","My mother is a teacher, my father is a driver, and my sister is a student.":"Hooyaday waa macalin, aabbahay waa darawal, walaashayna waa ardayad.","My mother is a teacher.":"Hooyaday waa macalin.","My mother knows English well, my sister speaks French, and my father speaks Russian.":"Hooyaday waxay si fiican u taqaanaa Ingiriisiga, walaashay waxay ku hadashaa Faransiiska, aabbahayna wuxuu ku hadlaa Ruushka.","My mother lives in Athens, my father lives in Cyprus, and I live in Nicosia.":"Hooyaday waxay ku nooshahay Athens, aabbahay wuxuu ku nool yahay Qubrus, anna waxaan ku noolahay Nicosia.","My sister is single, lives in Athens, and is an engineer.":"Walaashay waa doob, waxay ku nooshahay Athens, waana injineer.","My wife lives in Nicosia, my daughter is from Cyprus, and my father lives in Greece.":"Xaaskayga waxay ku nooshahay Nicosia, gabadhaydu waxay ka timid Qubrus, aabbahayna wuxuu ku nool yahay Giriigga.","Nice to meet you!":"Wacan inaan kula kulmo!","Nicosia":"Nicosia","Nikos has a male friend in Cyprus, a female friend in Greece, and a brother in Russia.":"Nikos wuxuu leeyahay saaxiib lab ah Qubrus, saaxiib dumar ah oo Giriig ah, iyo walaal ku sugan Ruushka.","On Monday I work in the morning, but on Sunday I sleep a lot.":"Maalinta Isniinta waxaan shaqeeyaa subaxdii, laakiin Axadda aad ayaan u seexdaa.","On Saturday I meet friends, we have coffee and then go to the cinema.":"Sabtida waxaan la kulmaa saaxiibo, waxaan cabnaa kafee ka dibna aadaa shineemo.","Please wait in the queue.":"Fadlan ku sug safka","Russia":"Ruushka","Russian (language)":"Ruush (luqad)","Saturday":"Sabti","Shall we go for a walk this evening?":"Ma fiidkan socod ma tagno?","She is Greek.":"Iyadu waa Giriig.","Sorry, I do not understand.":"Waan ka xumahay, ma fahmin.","Spanish (language)":"Isbaanish (luqad)","Sunday":"Axad","The apartment has two bedrooms.":"Gurigu wuxuu leeyahay laba qol oo jiif ah.","The bill, please.":"Biilka, fadlan.","The book costs ten euros and the notebook costs three.":"Buuggu waxa uu qiimihiisu yahay toban euro,buu